<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<%- include('partials/_head.ejs') %>
<body class="tt-body">
  <%- include('partials/_header.ejs') %>
  <main class="tt-shell">
    <section class="tt-hero">
      <p class="tt-kicker">Strategic Teddy Card Battler</p>
      <h1>Terrible Teddies</h1>
      <p class="tt-lede">Collect unhinged teddy fighters, battle in the fluff pit, unlock rarities, and build toward paid Founder Packs, cosmetics, and seasonal drops.</p>
      <div class="tt-actions">
        <a href="/play" class="tt-button tt-button-primary">Play Demo Now</a>
        <a href="/teddies" class="tt-button tt-button-muted">Open Collection</a>
      </div>
      <% if (typeof demoMode !== 'undefined' && demoMode) { %>
        <p class="tt-demo-note">Demo mode is active, so the playable demo runs without MongoDB.</p>
      <% } %>
    </section>

    <section class="tt-feature-grid">
      <article>
        <h2>Playable immediately</h2>
        <p>The /play route uses a built-in deck and deterministic battle engine, so the game can run locally even before database setup.</p>
      </article>
      <article>
        <h2>Built for paid packs</h2>
        <p>Set FOUNDER_PACK_URL in hosting settings to turn the demo page into a payment-ready landing page.</p>
      </article>
      <article>
        <h2>Expandable backend</h2>
        <p>The existing Express, MongoDB, sessions, marketplace, teams, challenges, and API routes remain available for the full account-based game.</p>
      </article>
    </section>
  </main>
  <%- include('partials/_footer.ejs') %>
</body>
</html>
